1
00:00:36,590 --> 00:00:41,590
an oil or a liquid, at some stage you will have to dissolve it in a solvent.
油状物还是液体，在某个阶段你都得把它溶解在溶剂里。

2
00:00:41,590 --> 00:00:45,590
Whether you need it as a solution so that you can run a reaction,
无论你需要把它配成溶液是为了进行反应，

3
00:00:45,590 --> 00:00:48,590
or perhaps a chromatographic purification,
还是为了进行色谱纯化，

4
00:00:48,590 --> 00:00:51,590
when you're done, you will need to remove the solvent
完成之后，你都需要除去溶剂，

5
00:00:51,590 --> 00:00:54,590
in order to isolate the purer compound.
以便分离出更纯的化合物。

6
00:00:54,590 --> 00:00:57,590
Luckily, a very useful piece of laboratory equipment
幸运的是，有一种非常有用的实验室设备，

7
00:00:57,590 --> 00:01:00,590
called a rotary evaporator, or a rotabap,
叫做旋转蒸发仪（rotavap），

8
00:01:00,590 --> 00:01:02,590
was designed for just this use.
就是专门为此设计的。

9
00:01:02,590 --> 00:01:05,590
While rotabaps are very easy to use,
虽然旋转蒸发仪很容易使用，

10
00:01:05,590 --> 00:01:09,590
there are a few general rules of operation that you will need to follow.
但还是有几条基本操作规则需要你遵守。

11
00:01:09,590 --> 00:01:13,590
This video will demonstrate the correct use of a rotabap.
本视频将演示旋转蒸发仪的正确使用方法。

12
00:01:13,590 --> 00:01:20,340
While rotabaps come in a variety of different styles,
旋转蒸发仪有多种不同的样式，

13
00:01:20,340 --> 00:01:24,340
they are all made up of the same fundamental pieces.
但它们都由相同的基本部件组成。

14
00:01:24,340 --> 00:01:30,340
These are a vacuum line to reduce the pressure inside of the whole rotabap system.
这些部件包括：一条真空管路，用来降低整个旋转蒸发仪系统内部的压力。

15
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:35,340
Remember, solvents boil at lower temperatures under reduced atmosphere.
记住，在减压下溶剂的沸点会降低。

16
00:01:35,340 --> 00:01:40,340
A hot water bath used to warm the flask containing your dissolved material.
一个热水浴，用来加热装有你所溶解物料的烧瓶。

17
00:01:40,340 --> 00:01:42,340
Evaporation is a cooling process,
蒸发是一个吸热降温的过程，

18
00:01:42,340 --> 00:01:46,340
so you need to add a little heat to evaporate the solvent.
所以你需要加一点热才能使溶剂蒸发。

19
00:01:46,340 --> 00:01:51,340
A nice clean bump trap to which you will attach your flask.
一个洁净的防暴沸球，你的烧瓶就接在它上面。

20
00:01:51,340 --> 00:01:54,340
This useful piece of glassware will prevent any of your material
这个有用的玻璃器件可以防止你的任何物料

21
00:01:54,340 --> 00:01:58,340
from ending up inside the rest of the rotabap.
跑到旋转蒸发仪的其他部分里去。

22
00:01:58,340 --> 00:02:01,340
A rotary motor that spins your flask
一个旋转电机，用来转动你的烧瓶，

23
00:02:01,340 --> 00:02:04,340
and spreads the solvent out on the flask walls.
使溶剂在烧瓶壁上铺展开。

24
00:02:04,340 --> 00:02:09,340
This creates more surface area and allows for rapid evaporation of the solvent.
这样能增大表面积，使溶剂快速蒸发。

25
00:02:09,340 --> 00:02:14,340
A cooled condenser to condense the solvent vapor from your flask
一个冷却的冷凝管，用来冷凝来自烧瓶的溶剂蒸气，

26
00:02:14,340 --> 00:02:18,340
and a receiver to collect the condensed solvent.
还有一个接收瓶，用来收集冷凝下来的溶剂。

27
00:02:18,340 --> 00:02:24,340
If all goes well, the solvent that starts out in your flask ends up in the receiver
如果一切顺利，原本在烧瓶里的溶剂最终会进入接收瓶，

28
00:02:24,340 --> 00:02:27,340
while your material stays put in your flask.
而你的物料则留在烧瓶里。

29
00:02:27,340 --> 00:02:29,340
Rotabap operation is very simple,
旋转蒸发仪的操作非常简单，

30
00:02:29,340 --> 00:02:32,340
but there are a few guidelines that you need to follow
但有几条准则你需要遵守，

31
00:02:32,340 --> 00:02:35,340
to avoid some potentially painful mistakes.
以免犯下一些可能很惨痛的错误。

32
00:02:35,340 --> 00:02:40,340
Rule number one, tie back your hair and avoid loose sleeves.
第一条规则：把头发扎起来，不要穿宽松的袖子。

33
00:02:40,340 --> 00:02:44,340
The rotary motor on the rotabap is a potential safety hazard.
旋转蒸发仪上的旋转电机是一个潜在的安全隐患。

34
00:02:44,340 --> 00:02:50,340
Take care not to lean too close or dangle your hair, clothing, or jewelry near the motor.
注意不要靠得太近，也不要让头发、衣物或首饰垂到电机附近。

35
00:02:50,340 --> 00:02:55,340
Otherwise, you may end up saying a painful goodbye to some precious material,
否则，你可能会痛苦地失去一些宝贵的东西，

36
00:02:55,340 --> 00:02:57,340
maybe even your scalp.
甚至可能是你的头皮。

37
00:02:57,340 --> 00:03:04,160
Rule number two, never fill your flask more than half full.
第二条规则：烧瓶装液绝不要超过一半。

38
00:03:04,160 --> 00:03:06,160
When preparing to use the rotabap,
准备使用旋转蒸发仪时，

39
00:03:06,160 --> 00:03:10,160
you never want to fill your round bottom flask more than half full.
圆底烧瓶里的液体绝不要超过一半。

40
00:03:10,160 --> 00:03:13,160
Even if you have a large volume of solution to concentrate,
即使你有大量溶液需要浓缩，

41
00:03:13,160 --> 00:03:17,160
it will never save you time to overfill the flask.
把烧瓶装得过满也绝不会帮你节省时间。

42
00:03:17,160 --> 00:03:23,160
It will most likely lead to an unfortunate and time-consuming problem called bumping.
这很可能会导致一个麻烦又费时的问题，叫做暴沸。

43
00:03:23,160 --> 00:03:27,160
In other words, your material will take a trip to the bump trap.
换句话说，你的物料会跑进防暴沸球里。

44
00:03:27,160 --> 00:03:30,160
This will require you to rinse the bump trap with solvent,
这样你就得用溶剂冲洗防暴沸球，

45
00:03:30,160 --> 00:03:34,160
adding even more to the overall volume you need to concentrate.
使需要浓缩的总体积变得更大。

46
00:03:34,160 --> 00:03:41,460
Rule number three, make sure there are no solids in the flask.
第三条规则：确保烧瓶中没有固体。

47
00:03:41,460 --> 00:03:43,460
This includes stir bars.
这包括搅拌子。

48
00:03:43,460 --> 00:03:50,180
They may seem harmless, but they can also lead to bumping.
它们看起来可能无害，但也会导致暴沸。

49
00:03:50,180 --> 00:03:54,180
Rule number four, always use a clean bump trap.
第四条规则：始终使用洁净的防暴沸球。

50
00:03:54,180 --> 00:03:57,180
Even when you're careful, bumping can happen.
即使你很小心，暴沸也可能发生。

51
00:03:57,180 --> 00:04:01,180
Therefore, you should always thoroughly wash the bump trap
因此，使用之前你都应该彻底清洗防暴沸球，

52
00:04:01,180 --> 00:04:04,180
and rinse it with solvent before you use it.
并用溶剂冲洗。

53
00:04:04,180 --> 00:04:07,180
You never know what someone else may have left inside,
你永远不知道别人可能在里面留下了什么，

54
00:04:07,180 --> 00:04:11,180
and you don't want it to end up mixed with your material.
你也不希望那些东西混进你的物料里。

55
00:04:11,180 --> 00:04:15,180
But before you attach the bump trap or your flask to the rotabap,
不过，在把防暴沸球或烧瓶接到旋转蒸发仪上之前，

56
00:04:15,180 --> 00:04:21,180
proceed to rule number five, cool the condenser and the receiver.
先执行第五条规则：冷却冷凝管和接收瓶。

57
00:04:21,180 --> 00:04:25,180
Make sure that cold water is circulating through the condenser
确保冷水在冷凝管中循环流动，

58
00:04:25,180 --> 00:04:28,180
and place the receiver in an ice bath.
并把接收瓶放在冰浴中。

59
00:04:28,180 --> 00:04:31,180
Make sure that minimal solvent vapor makes it out of the rotabap
确保只有极少量的溶剂蒸气离开旋转蒸发仪

60
00:04:31,180 --> 00:04:34,180
and into the vacuum line.
进入真空管路。

61
00:04:34,180 --> 00:04:37,180
Now you are ready to put your half-filled,
现在你可以把这个装液一半、

62
00:04:37,180 --> 00:04:40,180
solid-free flask on the rotabap.
不含固体的烧瓶装到旋转蒸发仪上了。

63
00:04:40,180 --> 00:04:43,180
Attach your flask securely to the bump trap
把烧瓶牢固地接到防暴沸球上，

64
00:04:43,180 --> 00:04:47,180
using a Keck clip and an adapter if necessary.
必要时使用 Keck 夹和转接头。

65
00:04:47,180 --> 00:04:53,390
Rule number six, pull vacuum just a little bit
第六条规则：先稍微抽一点真空，

66
00:04:53,390 --> 00:04:56,390
before spinning your flask.
再转动烧瓶。

67
00:04:56,390 --> 00:04:58,390
After you attach your flask,
接好烧瓶后，

68
00:04:58,390 --> 00:05:01,390
open the system up to a little bit of vacuum
让系统抽一点点真空，

69
00:05:01,390 --> 00:05:03,390
and start the rotary motor.
然后启动旋转电机。

70
00:05:03,390 --> 00:05:06,390
If you start the spinning first without the vacuum
如果你在没有真空的情况下就先开始旋转，

71
00:05:06,390 --> 00:05:08,390
to hold everything in place,
没有真空把各部件固定住，

72
00:05:08,390 --> 00:05:15,210
your flask and the bump trap might end up floating in the water bath.
你的烧瓶和防暴沸球可能最后会漂在水浴里。

73
00:05:15,210 --> 00:05:17,210
Rule number seven,
第七条规则：

74
00:05:17,210 --> 00:05:21,210
open the vacuum line slowly to start the evaporation.
缓慢打开真空管路，开始蒸发。

75
00:05:21,210 --> 00:05:26,210
Watch your flask carefully to make sure that the bubbling is under control
仔细观察烧瓶，确保鼓泡在控制之中，

76
00:05:26,210 --> 00:05:30,210
and reduce the vacuum if it looks like it is going too fast.
如果看起来蒸发太快，就减小真空度。

77
00:05:30,210 --> 00:05:33,210
Opening the vacuum line too fast is another good way
真空管路开得太快，也是

78
00:05:33,210 --> 00:05:36,210
to get your material to bump.
让物料暴沸的另一个“好办法”。

79
00:05:36,210 --> 00:05:39,210
When you have achieved a stable rate of evaporation,
蒸发速率稳定之后，

80
00:05:39,210 --> 00:05:43,210
lower the flask into the hot water bath.
把烧瓶降入热水浴中。

81
00:05:43,210 --> 00:05:48,210
This will prevent the flask from icing up as it cools during evaporation,
这样可以防止烧瓶在蒸发降温时结冰，

82
00:05:48,210 --> 00:05:53,840
and it will help the concentration to proceed at a reasonable rate.
也有助于浓缩以合理的速度进行。

83
00:05:53,840 --> 00:05:57,840
Leave your flask on the rotabap until the sample becomes viscous
把烧瓶一直留在旋转蒸发仪上，直到样品变得黏稠

84
00:05:57,840 --> 00:06:00,840
and sticks to the sides of the flask.
并粘在烧瓶壁上。

85
00:06:00,840 --> 00:06:02,840
Depending on the viscosity of your material,
根据物料的黏度不同，

86
00:06:02,840 --> 00:06:06,840
it may even form a ring around the middle of the flask.
它甚至可能在烧瓶中部形成一圈。

87
00:06:06,840 --> 00:06:11,840
Solid material will most likely solidify when concentration is complete.
固体物料在浓缩完成时很可能会凝固。

88
00:06:11,840 --> 00:06:14,840
Now you are ready to remove your flask.
现在可以取下烧瓶了。

89
00:06:14,840 --> 00:06:18,840
To do so, turn off the rotary motor,
为此，先关闭旋转电机，

90
00:06:18,840 --> 00:06:21,840
release the vacuum, and undo the ket clip.
解除真空，然后松开 Keck 夹。

91
00:06:21,840 --> 00:06:24,840
You can proceed to a high vacuum pump
如果需要除去样品中残留的少量溶剂，

92
00:06:24,840 --> 00:06:31,530
if you need to remove the small amount of solvent still in your sample.
你可以接着用高真空泵处理。

93
00:06:31,530 --> 00:06:35,530
Let's quickly recap the rotabap rules that we have learned.
我们来快速回顾一下学过的旋转蒸发仪规则。

94
00:06:35,530 --> 00:06:40,530
Rule number one, tie back your hair and avoid loose sleeves.
第一条规则：把头发扎起来，不要穿宽松的袖子。

95
00:06:40,530 --> 00:06:45,530
Rule number two, never fill your flask more than half full.
第二条规则：烧瓶装液绝不要超过一半。

96
00:06:45,530 --> 00:06:50,530
Rule number three, no solids should be in your flask.
第三条规则：烧瓶中不应有固体。

97
00:06:50,530 --> 00:06:54,530
Rule number four, always use a clean bump trap.
第四条规则：始终使用洁净的防暴沸球。

98
00:06:54,530 --> 00:06:58,530
Rule number five, cool the condenser and the receiver
第五条规则：在接上烧瓶之前，

99
00:06:58,530 --> 00:07:01,530
before you attach your flask.
先冷却冷凝管和接收瓶。

100
00:07:01,530 --> 00:07:04,530
Rule number six, pull vacuum just a little bit
第六条规则：先稍微抽一点真空，

101
00:07:04,530 --> 00:07:08,530
before turning on the rotary motor to spin your flask.
再打开旋转电机转动烧瓶。

102
00:07:08,530 --> 00:07:12,530
And rule number seven, open the vacuum line slowly
第七条规则：缓慢打开真空管路，

103
00:07:12,530 --> 00:07:17,700
so that you don't cause your material to bump.
以免使物料暴沸。

104
00:07:17,700 --> 00:07:21,700
Remember, this video is intended to help you prepare for lab
记住，本视频旨在通过演示正确的实验技术，

105
00:07:21,700 --> 00:07:25,700
by providing a demonstration of the proper experimental technique.
帮助你为实验做好准备。

106
00:07:25,700 --> 00:07:28,700
It is not intended as a replacement for reading your lab manual
它并不能代替阅读你的实验手册

107
00:07:28,700 --> 00:07:31,700
or the supplementary material.
或补充材料。

108
00:07:31,700 --> 00:07:33,700
In order to become a great experimentalist,
要成为一名优秀的实验工作者，

109
00:07:33,700 --> 00:07:37,700
it is important that you understand both theory and technique.
重要的是既要理解理论，也要掌握技术。

110
00:07:37,700 --> 00:07:40,700
Now it's your turn. Good luck.
现在轮到你了。祝你好运。
